#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"channel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cpsc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"deadline\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"24_hours\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"reference\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CPSA Sec. 15(b); 16 CFR 1115\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"rule_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"GB-DANGEROUS-GOODS-NOTIFY\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"market\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"GB\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"category\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"producer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"distributor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"obligation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"notify_enforcement_authority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"channel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"local_authority_trading_standards\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"deadline\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"immediately\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"reference\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"General Product Safety Regulations 2005 reg. 9\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>把 <code>reference</code> 作为一个必填字段，而不是写进说明文档，是为了让每条规则的来源可追溯。当规则变更（例如 GPSR 实施指引更新）时，能按 <code>reference</code> 精确找出受影响的所有格子，而不是通读整份文档。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三法域的责任主体对照\">三法域的责任主体对照</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>欧盟 (GPSR)</th>\n<th>美国 (CPSA)</th>\n<th>英国 GB (GPSR 2005)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>境内责任主体</td>\n<td>责任人：进口商/分销商/授权代表</td>\n<td>无强制境内代理人制度，直接对 CPSC 负责</td>\n<td>生产者与分销商直接对执法机构负责</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品牌方地位</td>\n<td>可作为制造商</td>\n<td>品牌方通常被视为制造商</td>\n<td>视为生产者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>履约服务商</td>\n<td>明确纳入，须校验标识</td>\n<td>无对应角色</td>\n<td>无对应角色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线上市场</td>\n<td>须向 Safety Gate 登记、指定联络点、配合下架</td>\n<td>平台义务主要来自其它法律（如 INFORM Act）</td>\n<td>无对应专门义务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>监管机构</td>\n<td>成员国主管机构 + 委员会</td>\n<td>CPSC</td>\n<td>地方贸易标准部门 / OPSS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预警系统</td>\n<td>Safety Gate</td>\n<td>无对等公开预警系统</td>\n<td>无对等系统，与欧盟机制已分离</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第二行与第三行是跨境卖家最常踩的两个坑。品牌方在欧美都容易被认定为制造商（即使实际生产在代工厂），这意味着品牌方不能以&quot;我只是贴牌&quot;为由免除制造商义务；履约服务商这一角色目前主要是欧盟制度下的产物，做欧盟海外仓业务时必须单独建模。</p>\n<h3 id=\"报送渠道的路由\">报送渠道的路由</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>触发事件</th>\n<th>欧盟</th>\n<th>美国</th>\n<th>英国</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>严重风险/事故</td>\n<td>Safety Business Gateway（2 个工作日）</td>\n<td>CPSC（24 小时）</td>\n<td>执法机构（尽快）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自愿召回</td>\n<td>通知主管机构 + 可进 Safety Gate</td>\n<td>提交纠正行动计划待批</td>\n<td>通知执法机构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>强制召回</td>\n<td>主管机构可实施撤回、召回</td>\n<td>CPSC 可下令停止分销与通知</td>\n<td>执法机构可发出撤回/召回通知</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三列的时限口径不同（工作日 / 24 小时 / 尽快），因此内部计时器必须按市场分别配置，而不能取最小值一刀切——取最小值虽然安全，但会让欧盟侧的常规流程被不必要地压缩，长期看会削弱流程的可执行性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"品类层级的覆盖规则\">品类层级的覆盖规则</h2><p>一般安全要求是兜底，品类专项法规优先。矩阵必须显式表达这个&quot;覆盖&quot;关系，否则系统会同时施加两套要求，产生冲突。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"create table market_safety_rule (&#10;  rule_id       text primary key,&#10;  market        text not null,&#10;  category_path text not null,        -- &#39;*&#39; 或具体品类路径&#10;  role          text not null,&#10;  obligation    text not null,&#10;  channel       text,&#10;  deadline_kind text,                 -- hours_24 | working_days_2 | immediate&#10;  severity      text not null,        -- block | warn&#10;  reference     text not null&#10;);&#10;&#10;create table rule_override (&#10;  overriding_rule_id text not null references market_safety_rule(rule_id),&#10;  overridden_rule_id text not null references market_safety_rule(rule_id),&#10;  scope_note         text not null,&#10;  primary key (overriding_rule_id, overridden_rule_id)&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 某商品的适用规则集：先取品类专项，再补一般要求中未被覆盖的条目&#10;with applicable as (&#10;  select r.*&#10;  from market_safety_rule r&#10;  where r.market = $1&#10;    and ($2 like r.category_path or r.category_path = &#39;*&#39;)&#10;    and r.role = $3&#10;)&#10;select a.rule_id, a.obligation, a.channel, a.deadline_kind&#10;from applicable a&#10;where not exists (&#10;  select 1 from rule_override o&#10;  where o.overridden_rule_id = a.rule_id&#10;    and o.overriding_rule_id in (select rule_id from applicable)&#10;)&#10;order by a.severity desc, a.rule_id;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">create</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> table</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> market_safety_rule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> primary key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  market        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  category_path </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- '*' 或具体品类路径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  role</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  obligation    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  channel       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  deadline_kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                 </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- hours_24 | working_days_2 | immediate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  severity      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- block | warn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reference     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">create</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> table</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rule_override</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  overriding_rule_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> references</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> market_safety_rule(rule_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  overridden_rule_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> references</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> market_safety_rule(rule_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  scope_note         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  primary key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (overriding_rule_id, overridden_rule_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 某商品的适用规则集：先取品类专项，再补一般要求中未被覆盖的条目</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> applicable </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  select</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> market_safety_rule r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  where</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">market</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ($</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> like</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">category_path</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> or</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">category_path</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    and</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">role</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">select</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rule_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">obligation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">channel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">deadline_kind</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> applicable a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">where</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> exists</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  select</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rule_override o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  where</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">overridden_rule_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rule_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    and</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">overriding_rule_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">select</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rule_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> applicable)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">order by</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">severity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> desc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rule_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>rule_override</code> 这张表是矩阵能否长期维护的关键。没有它，&quot;玩具要符合 EN 71 所以不必再看一般安全要求&quot;这类判断就只能靠人记住，而记忆在品类数量上升后必然失效。用显式的覆盖关系记录，可以让每条一般要求的失效都有明确理由。</p>\n<h3 id=\"严重度字段的作用\">严重度字段的作用</h3><p><code>severity</code> 分 <code>block</code> 与 <code>warn</code> 两档，对应商品能否上线。把&quot;缺责任人信息&quot;标为 <code>block</code>、&quot;标签语言缺失&quot;标为 <code>warn</code>，可以让合规检查在商品发布流程里自动分流——阻断项不放行，警告项放行但进入待办队列。这与海外仓入库校验中&quot;身份缺陷 vs 表达缺陷&quot;的区分是同一原则在不同环节的应用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规则变更的应对\">规则变更的应对</h2><p>安全规则不是静态的。新法规生效、既有法规被替代、实施指引更新，都会让矩阵里的若干格子失效。因此矩阵需要版本化与影响面分析。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变更类型</th>\n<th>影响面</th>\n<th>处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>新法规生效</td>\n<td>新增规则行</td>\n<td>追加 + 回填在售商品的适用集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>法规被替代</td>\n<td>引用该法规的所有行</td>\n<td>更新 <code>reference</code> + 复核 <code>rule_override</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实施指引更新</td>\n<td>判定标准变化</td>\n<td>更新规则参数，不新增行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新增市场</td>\n<td>空列</td>\n<td>补齐责任主体与报送渠道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新增品类</td>\n<td>空行</td>\n<td>按品类专项法规补齐并声明覆盖关系</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第二行是最容易出错的：法规被替代时，覆盖关系往往需要重新评估。例如某品类专项法规换版后，原本被它覆盖的一般安全要求条目可能重新生效。这类变化必须触发一次全量复核，而不是只改引用字段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>合规空间由市场、品类、角色三轴张成，角色判定需按商品×市场独立计算。</li>\n<li>规则应存成可被系统消费的配置，且每条规则带 <code>reference</code> 以便追溯影响面。</li>\n<li>品牌方在欧美均易被认定为制造商；履约服务商是欧盟特有角色。</li>\n<li>报送时限口径各市场不同，计时器须分别配置。</li>\n<li>品类专项法规优先于一般要求，覆盖关系须显式建模。</li>\n<li><code>severity</code> 分阻断与警告，用于发布流程自动分流。</li>\n<li>法规被替代时必须复核覆盖关系，而非只改引用。</li>\n<li>规则矩阵触发的事故响应流程见 <a href=\"recall-playbook-drill\">召回预案与时效演练</a>。</li>\n<li>欧盟侧责任主体的具体义务见 <a href=\"../product-safety-baseline/responsible-person-fsp-obligation\">欧盟责任人/UKRP/履约服务商义务</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>参考来源：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/General_Product_Safety_Regulation\">General Product Safety Regulation — Wikipedia</a>（适用日期 2024-12-13、欧盟责任人、线上市场登记与联络点、两个工作日事故报告）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/General_Product_Safety_Regulations_2005\">General Product Safety Regulations 2005 — Wikipedia</a>（英国 reg. 5 安全产品义务、reg. 7 消费者信息、reg. 8 分销商注意义务、reg. 9 危险品通知执法机构）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/uscode/text/15/2064\">15 U.S.C. § 2064 — Cornell LII</a>（制造商、分销商、零售商的报告义务；CPSC 的第 15(c)/(d) 条命令权限）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Office_for_Product_Safety_and_Standards\">Office for Product Safety and Standards — Wikipedia</a>（英国消费品安全监管机构，不含车辆、药品、食品）</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"各市场安全规则与责任主体矩阵","id":"各市场安全规则与责任主体矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三个正交的轴","id":"核心概念-三个正交的轴"},{"level":2,"text":"矩阵的结构化表达","id":"矩阵的结构化表达"},{"level":2,"text":"三法域的责任主体对照","id":"三法域的责任主体对照"},{"level":3,"text":"报送渠道的路由","id":"报送渠道的路由"},{"level":2,"text":"品类层级的覆盖规则","id":"品类层级的覆盖规则"},{"level":3,"text":"严重度字段的作用","id":"严重度字段的作用"},{"level":2,"text":"规则变更的应对","id":"规则变更的应对"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"召回预案与时效演练","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-safety-incident-recall-gpsr/recall-governance/recall-playbook-drill"},"next":{"title":"召回成本、品牌影响与改进闭环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-safety-incident-recall-gpsr/recall-governance/recall-cost-brand-impact"}}